# Tools for .github/workflows/ansible.yml (GHA-09). No versions here on purpose: they live in requirements-ci.txt,
# which Renovate keeps updated, hashes included. Regenerate that file with the command in its header, run from this
# directory: uv keeps the current pins, adds any new dependency, and moves everything to its latest with --upgrade.
# It resolves for the runner (ubuntu-26.04's python3, 3.14, on x86_64); the hashes cover every file PyPI has per pin.
ansible-core
ansible-lint
